[P_04_Penthouse_Briefings]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - Bruce Morgenholt and Abrahim Zherkezhi were partnered together on Project Watson, the UN Committee that cracked the Masse kernels. They're the ones who discovered Five-Twelve encryption, the same encryption used in the messages you recovered at MCAS Bank. If this so-called 'Dvorak' person has somehow gotten his hands on Masse-based IW algos, we're in a world of hurt.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0002L=GRIMSDOTTIR - I've been trying to penetrate Zherkezhi's private networks since we connected him to this mess. I've seen some tough network security before, and I expected Zherkezhi to have top of the line tech, but this is crazy. Zherkezhi's server isn't just impenetrable or invisible...it's like...it's like looking for a shadow in a pitch black room...it's driving me crazy...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=REDDING - Things are turning sour in New York. It's been 24 hours since the blackout and no one has a clue when it might end. We've got sporadic reports of unrest all over Manhattan, but it hasn't started to spill over yet. Word coming down from above is that the National Guard will be deployed within the hour. We'll need to insert you into an alley behind a building adjacent to the target building. Watch out for civilians.

[P_04_Penthouse_CamerasRestantes]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=REDDING - Good work Fisher. That's one camera tapped. There should be five more.
Speech_0002L=FISHER - I'll keep my eyes open.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=REDDING - One camera tapped. Five to go.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=REDDING - Good work Fisher. That's four of six cameras tapped.
Speech_0004L=FISHER - I'll keep an eye out for the other two.

[P_04_Penthouse_Conversation_Alley]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=You have enough light down here?
Speech_0002L=Think so. These barricade lights are battery operated, so they should be okay. I have flares too if I need 'em.
Speech_0003L=Alright... then we'll concentrate on getting power to the CP before we break-out to the perimeter.
Speech_0004L=Sounds good.

[P_04_Penthouse_Conversation_Green]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=How long have you known him?
Speech_0002L=Long time, long time. Since before Displace... huh... since before Bosnia.
Speech_0003L=Before Bosnia... good lord. I knew he had connections but -
Speech_0004L=Yeah... we know him long time. He treat us good. We do what he say.
Speech_0005L=Yes... yes, well, he certainly treats us well.
Speech_0006L=Now you know too. Now you work for him. Do what he say.
Speech_0007L=Yes, well... certainly... worth my while now, isn't it.
Speech_0008L=More than worth your while. Keep you alive man.

[P_04_Penthouse_Conversation_Lift]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=What's the status on that elevator?
Speech_0002L=I'll have it running in a sec.
Speech_0003L=Well speed it up. We need to get some more equipment up the roof.
Speech_0004L=I'm going as fast as I can.

[P_04_Penthouse_Conversation_Park]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0002L=Man... I can't even see my own feet. How long til we have power?
Speech_0004L=Not sure... they want to get the elevator working first so we can get to the helipad on the roof.
Speech_0005L=So where does that leave us?
Speech_0006L=In the dark...as usual.
Speech_0007L=I got an idea...what about these cars? Maybe we can turn the headlights on.
Speech_0008L=What are you gonna do, break into someone's car? That's hardly protecting the public.
Speech_0009L=We'll just blame it on the rioters...
Speech_0010L=Hm... good idea.

[P_04_Penthouse_Conversation_Patio]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Hey... I don't recognize you. How long have you been with Displace?
Speech_0004L=Three months... I just got transferred up from Peru... I was on the... ahem... VIP detail down there.
Speech_0005L=Ah... so you're already... uh... in the loop?
Speech_0006L=Yeah... me and... well, you know... we go way back.
Speech_0007L=Well stick with us... we know how to get things done.
Speech_0008L=I know... like I say... we go way back.
Speech_0009L=Riiiiight.

[P_04_Penthouse_Conversation_Power]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=So you know what I can't figure out... like... the entire city is dark, right?
Speech_0002L=Yeah...
Speech_0003L=But this guy over here... all his lights are on... how can that be?
Speech_0004L=Well, the richer you get, the more paranoid you get... guy probably has his own generator so he can keep his security system running.
Speech_0005L=Security system? Who's gonna climb fifteen floors to break into his apartment?
Speech_0006L=Like I said... paranoid.

[P_04_Penthouse_Conversation_Tech]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=How much longer is this gonna to take?
Speech_0002L=It'll be done when it's done.
Speech_0003L=Done when it's done? What kind of answer is that?
Speech_0004L=Hey, I got a 220 connection here at 16 amps...
Speech_0005L=So?
Speech_0006L=So you know what that kinda juice will do to you if the wires get crossed?
Speech_0007L=Uh... no...
Speech_0008L=Well here... touch right here and find out...
Speech_0009L=Uh... no thanks...
Speech_0010L=Yeah, good thinkin'. Now get lost, it'll be done when it's done.

