[P_04_Penthouse_Gnome_help]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - You must be Dvorak.
Speech_0002L=GNOME - Ahem...oh... well...Dvorak hm? I had thought this area was, well, off limits...
Speech_0003L=FISHER - You're not Dvorak?
Speech_0004L=GNOME - Well, ahem...since we're being blunt ... well...no.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Then who are you?
Speech_0008L=GNOME - Such a rush... hmm... Fancy some tea do you?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0011L=GNOME - Reminds me of poor old Jiggers... hahaha... ah Jiggers... we hardly knew ye...
Speech_0012L=FISHER - Who are you? What are you doing here?
Speech_0013L=GNOME - Oh... well, one might ask you the same...
Speech_0014L=FISHER - I'm looking for a man named Dvorak.
Speech_0015L=GNOME - Ah! Dvorak, yes! Hahaha... well, you're not going to find one... hahaha... this way...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0018L=GNOME - Ah... hahaha... yes... here we are then... This is Dvorak.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0021L=FISHER - Okay... If this is Dvorak... who are you?
Speech_0022L=GNOME - Ahem... I am Dvorak's keeper. Thank you most kindly for asking.
Speech_0027L=FISHER - And what is this... this... Dvorak?
Speech_0028L=GNOME - Dvorak is... well... you likely wouldn't understand...
Speech_0029L=FISHER - I'm positive you're right... but let's have it for the record anyway.
Speech_0030L=GNOME - Dvorak is a mechanical representation of a self-referential axiom of number theory. Dvorak encodes its own logical structure within its own executable cycle and recursively derives a more accurate representation of itself with each successive execution.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0032L=FISHER - I need your help.
Speech_0033L=GNOME - Indeed... what can I help you with my good fellow?
Speech_0034L=FISHER - I need you to help me initialize Dvorak so I can retrieve an output stack.
Speech_0035L=GNOME - Ah... Dvorak... well, that is certainly something I can help with... ahem... hahaha... why don't you restart it. I'll initialize the towers on this side...hahaha... ahem... you can do the other side.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0038L=GNOME - If you see Jigger's, tell him I miss him.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0040L=GNOME - Eventually, Dvorak will derive the answer. But eventually is a very long time...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0041L=GNOME - Ah...how terribly rude. Go about your business then.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0042L=GNOME - Ahem... in all honesty, sir... you've been terribly rude and I'd prefer not to talk to you.
Speech_-001L=(null)

