[P_04_Penthouse_Objectives]
Objective_0046=Get to Zherkezhi's penthouse in the adjacent building.
Objective_0047=Zherkezhi's penthouse apartment has power, and is connected to the roof by electrical cables attached to the large sign.
Objective_0004=Access Zherkezhi's Server to determine who Dvorak is.
Objective_0025=Access Zherkezhi's private terminal and find out who Dvorak is. The terminal is probably hidden somewhere near the master bedroom.
Note_0039L=The National Guard is on our side, don't kill any of them.
Objective_0003=Find out who the mercenaries work for.
Objective_0026=The men protecting Zherkezhi appear to be professional mercenaries. Find out who they work for by interrogating any of them or accessing any computer they may have brought.
POPUPMESSAGE_0053=Find out who the mercenaries work for.
Note_0021L=The mercenaries work for Displace International.
Note_0045L=The door code to Dvorak's room is 0280.
Objective_0005=Locate Dvorak.
Objective_0027=Go to the abandoned part of the building across the roof and locate Zherkezhi's associate, Dvorak.
POPUPMESSAGE_0054=Locate Dvorak.
Note_0040L=Dvorak is not a person. It's a computer.
Objective_0006=Retrieve a hardcopy output for a single Dvorak execution cycle.
Objective_0028=Restart the Dvorak computer without overheating it and recover a stack of punch cards that contains the data from its execution cycle.
POPUPMESSAGE_0055=Retrieve a hardcopy output for a single Dvorak execution cycle.
Objective_0011=Obtain the missing transaction records.
Objective_0029=Recover any additional information about dealings between Zherkezhi or Dvorak and MCAS Bank in Panama.
Objective_0007=Exfiltrate to the primary extraction point.
Objective_0030=Exfiltrate from the main elevator in the living room of Zherkezhi's penthouse.
Note_0051L=The mercenaries may be using wall mines to fortify their positions.
Objective_0013=(null)
Objective_0014=(null)
Objective_0015=(null)
Objective_0001=Find the architectural plans.
Objective_0032=Find the architectural plans.
Objective_0002=Tap the Penthouse video cameras.
Objective_0033=Tapping the security cameras that Zherkezhi has installed will facilitate Echelon's ability to more closely monitor his activities.
POPUPMESSAGE_0057=Tap the Penthouse video cameras.
Note_0041L=You can see the infrared light projected by IR cameras with Night Vision.
Objective_0008=Discover who is in charge of the Zherkezhi protection detail.
Objective_0034=Some of the guards may know who is in charge of the Zherkezhi protection detail. Ask around.
POPUPMESSAGE_0058=Discover who is in charge of the Zherkezhi protection detail.
Note_0022L=The VIP protection leader is Milan Nedich.
Objective_0035=Get to Zherkezhi's penthouse in the adjacent building.
Objective_0036=Zherkezhi's penthouse apartment has power, and is connected to the roof by electrical cables attached to the large sign.
Objective_0037=Get to the top of the building being used by the National Guard.
Objective_0038=The National Guard is restoring power to activate the elevator and set up a Command Post atop the building. Make your way up the shaft, or try to hitch a ride.
Note_0042L=The mercenaries may be using wall mines to fortify their positions.
Note_0048L=Medical kits are located in the bathrooms of the penthouse.
Note_0043L=There is a medical kit in the construction area.
Note_0044L=There is a medical kit in Zherkezhis panic room.

