Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - Sweet Jesus Fisher... what did you do?
Speech_0002L=FISHER - It was an accident.
Speech_0003L=LAMBERT - We don't have room for accidents. Watch your fire.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=LAMBERT - Dammit, Sam. You killed a civilian. Watch your fire.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=LAMBERT - Dammit Fisher... that's the second civilian you've killed.
Speech_0006L=FISHER - Lambert... I...
Speech_0007L=LAMBERT - Save the whining for your evaluation. Complete your Primary Objectives and forget the rest. You're a hazard.
Speech_0009L=FISHER - Roger.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0008L=LAMBERT - That's two civilians Fisher. You've lost your edge. I'm canceling your additional objectives. Complete your Primaries and extract ASAP.

