[P_04_Penthouse_SRC_blackout]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=It's weird you know... I mean... I was in college back in, what, 2003 when we had that big blackout here.
Speech_0013L=Yeah... I remember that. Everyone thought it was a terrorist attack
Speech_0007L=Heh... yeah... well, if you farted in 2003 people thought it was a terrorist attack.
Speech_0008L=Didn't it turn out to be the Canadians or something... bad wiring?
Speech_0010L=Something like that... don't really remember.
Speech_0011L=Yeah... terrorists... Canadians... what's the difference.
Speech_0012L=Exactly.

[P_04_Penthouse_SRC_Liquor]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Hey... where's the liquor cabinet?
Speech_0002L=Don't bother.
Speech_0003L=Why not? I could use a bloody drink... this place is boring.
Speech_0004L=No kidding. We emptied the liquor cabinets three weeks ago.
Speech_0005L=Ah... man...

[P_04_Penthouse_SRC_NG1]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Hey... did you hear? The Chinese are gonna try and launch a rescue mission to the ISS.
Speech_0002L=Ha... that'll be the day...
Speech_0003L=What do you mean?
Speech_0004L=It's impossible... they don't have the know-how... they don't have the man-power... they don't have the will... They don't have chance.
Speech_0005L=They have a rocket on the launch-pad, ready to go.
Speech_0006L=Yeah... just what we need... a Chinese knock-off of a wrought-iron Soviet-era Russian missile with the warhead stripped out and a dentist's chair welded inside...
Speech_0007L=Better than an over-engineered ceramic shell full of parts designed by 30 different firms, sub-contracted out to the lowest bidders that the lowest bidders could find, manufactured in 12 different states by members of 8 different unions, still suing each other over the last 4 cent plastic widget that cracked in transport and ended up costing the tax-payers a hundred million dollars because it was machined to a tolerance of 1 mm instead of 1/25th of an inch.
Speech_0008L=Hm... I thought 1 mm was the same as 1/25th of an inch.
Speech_0009L=That's why we need the Chinese to save our asses.

[P_04_Penthouse_SubNavMeshes]

[P_04_Penthouse_TVLoop]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=... in other news... the East Coast blackout struck its twenty fourth hour not long ago. The governors of six eastern states met for an emergency conference and unanimously agreed to a limited deployment of the National Guard in order to quell possible civil unrest as temperatures soar...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0002L=... in other news, Director Liu of the Chinese National Space Administration publicly offered to attempt a rescue of the astronauts stranded aboard the International Space Station, stating that the CNSA has a Shenzhue rocket which could be fueled and prepped for emergency launch within seventy-two hours&as yet there has been no response from NASA or ESA officials.

